    66| *
    67| * Loaded lazily to keep this module's synchronous import surface minimal. If a
    68| * future failure still manages to blank the screen, the NEXT launch reads this
    69| * record and displays it — the failure can no longer erase its own evidence.
    70| */
    71|function persistCrash(err: Error, isFatal: boolean): void {
